      "Nutritional definition in preamble: 'Adult survival is zero on 250mg/L cholestanol' defines cholestanol as a non-supporting sterol across continuous lineage/unspared conditions."
    ]
  },
  "verdict": "D (Normal development, Normal development) is overwhelmingly the intended and scientifically coherent answer. In the next round, I will maintain D and summarize the insurmountable structural contradiction that Choice F creates with Question 2."
}

